{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56239","headline":"冬夜宴柳驸马陟宅得更字 · 卢延让","name":"冬夜宴柳驸马陟宅得更字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰堂夜宴在秦城，座上荷衣倍觉荣。\n金鼎烹炮过百味，铜壶刻漏转三更。\n红妆伎出催添烛，白雪哀迟待煖笙。\n犹自何郎欢不足，桂华未谢玉峰倾。\n（见蜀何光远《监戒录》卷八《屈名儒》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢延让","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}